p>)</rp></ruby>は１<ruby>年中<rp>(</rp><rt>ねんじゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>テニスをします。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我全年都在打网球</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">年代</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ねんだい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">年代；时代；年份；时期</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"235884\">１９９０<ruby>年代<rp>(</rp><rt>ねんだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>湾岸戦争<rp>(</rp><rt>わんがんせんそう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>始<rp>(</rp><rt>はじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">1990年代始于海湾战争。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">念のため</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ねんのため</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a><span class=\"v-m\">以防万一</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n3/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">念</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">年齢</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ねんれい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">年龄；年岁</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"89604\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>同<rp>(</rp><rt>おな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じくらいの<ruby>年齢<rp>(</rp><rt>ねんれい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她大约跟我同年纪。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/840746\" title=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">野</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">の</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">田野；平原；（建筑物或物体的）隐蔽内部；野生的（用于动物或植物）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"219319\">この<ruby>野<rp>(</rp><rt>の</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>バラは<ruby>甘<rp>(</rp><rt>あま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>香<rp>(</rp><rt>かお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りを<ruby>放<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这朵野玫瑰散发出甜蜜的香味</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">能</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">のう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">才能；才华；功能；能剧；能乐</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"154645\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>能<rp>(</rp><rt>のう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>興味<rp>(</rp><rt>きょうみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>持<rp>(</rp><rt>も</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つアメリカ<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>じん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>会<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我碰到一个对能剧感兴趣的美国人。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/346713\" title=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · fucongcong\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">農家</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">のうか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">农民；农户；务农家庭；农舍；农家住宅；农家学派（中国古代）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"121711\"><ruby>農家<rp>(</rp><rt>のうか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>子<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>になりたいかね。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你想当个农场男孩吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">農業</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">のうぎょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">农业；农作</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"121705\"><ruby>農業<rp>(</rp><rt>のうぎょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>国<rp>(</rp><rt>くに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>経済<rp>(</rp><rt>けいざい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のもとである。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">农业是国家的经济。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">農民</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">のうみん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">农民；农夫</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"153068\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>貧<rp>(</rp><rt>まず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しい<ruby>農民<rp>(</rp><rt>のうみん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>過<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぎない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我只不过是个可怜的乡巴佬</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">能力</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">のうりょく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><sp