)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>時間<rp>(</rp><rt>じかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>があまりなくなってきた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">沙子快没了</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">残る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">のこる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a><span class=\"v-m\">留下；剩下</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n3/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">残</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">乗せる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">のせる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">放置于上；搭载；载送；装载；运载；搬上；播放；播出；欺骗；哄骗；跟着伴奏唱；让…参加；吸收；使兴奋；激起热情；刊登；刊载</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"178230\"><ruby>車<rp>(</rp><rt>くるま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>乗<rp>(</rp><rt>の</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>せてください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">载我一程你的车。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">除く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">のぞく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">除去；消除；去掉；清除；排除；除外；略去；剔除；除掉；消灭；诛杀</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"190768\"><ruby>医者<rp>(</rp><rt>いしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>苦痛<rp>(</rp><rt>くつう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>除<rp>(</rp><rt>のぞ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いてやった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">医生让他摆脱了痛苦。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">望み</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">のぞみ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">希望；愿望；欲望；前景；期待；展望</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"233025\">あなたの<ruby>望<rp>(</rp><rt>のぞ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みが<ruby>実現<rp>(</rp><rt>じつげん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>するといいですね。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我希望你的愿望会实现</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">望む</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">のぞむ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">渴望；希望；想要；期待；期望；盼望；俯瞰；眺望；居高临下</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"140808\"><ruby>全国民<rp>(</rp><rt>ぜんこくみん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>平和<rp>(</rp><rt>へいわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>望<rp>(</rp><rt>のぞ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んでいる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">整个国家都渴望和平。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">後</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">のち</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">后来；以后；之后；将来；未来；身后；去世后；后代；子孙</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"122897\"><ruby>日記<rp>(</rp><rt>にっき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>後<rp>(</rp><rt>のち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>書<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いた<ruby>本<rp>(</rp><rt>ほん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>基盤<rp>(</rp><rt>きばん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>となった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她的日记是她后来写的书的基础</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ノック</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">敲击；叩击；击球守备练习；击高飞球练习；按压；点击（如按动式圆珠笔或自动铅笔）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"137114\"><ruby>誰<rp>(</rp><rt>だれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かがドアをノックした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">有人敲门了</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">伸ばす</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">のばす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（头发、指甲等）长长；延长；伸长；拉长；伸出；递出；伸向；拉直；弄平；涂抹均匀；摊平（面团、奶油等）；稀释；冲淡；延迟；推迟；延长；拖长；加强；发展；扩大</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"189888\"><ruby>右腕<rp>(</rp><rt>みぎうで</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>伸<rp>(</rp><rt>の</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ばせません。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我右臂伸不直</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">伸びる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">のびる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">伸长；延长；拉长；生长（头发、身高、草等）；伸直；压平；变光滑；涂开；抹开（油漆、奶油等）；伸出；延伸（如手）；失去弹性；松弛；变软烂（如面条）；取得进展；发展；扩张；增加；提高；筋疲力尽；头昏眼花；被击晕；昏倒；倒下；延长；拖长（会议、寿命等）；延至（截止日期等）；变长（日子等）；延期；延误；推迟；获得关注；获得浏览量；表现良好（网络帖子、视频等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"146413\"><ruby>消費<rp>(</rp><rt>しょうひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>心持<rp>(</rp><rt>こころも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ち<ruby>伸<rp>(</rp><rt>の</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>びる<ruby>程度<rp>(</rp><rt>ていど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でしょう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">支出只会增长更快。</span></div></li>"]